{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Yiskah.</b> This is Sarah — so called because she would prophesy (מְסוּכָה) in the holy spirit, and because all would gaze (סוֹכִין) at her beauty. And further, יִסְכָָּה is a term of princesshood (נְסִיכוּת), like שָׂרָה is a term of rulership (שְׂרָרָה)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:20.051820109Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}